/P 3951 0 R
/T (Neglected Labor Welfare: Unsafe working conditions within nickel manufacturing companies are a major concern, with numerous workplace incidents causing fatalities and injuries between 2015 and 2023. Accidents such as toxic gas leaks highlight systemic vulnerabilities in occupational safety practices and regulatory audits. Problematic labor arrangements, including inadequate wages, excessive hours, and arbitrary dismissals, worsen the situation. Discrimination against female employees, such as barriers to menstrual leave and workplace harassment, further undermine worker welfare, leading to ethical concerns and the withdrawal of investors from nickel projects in Indonesia.)
/E (Neglected Labor Welfare: Unsafe working conditions within nickel manufacturing companies are a major concern, with numerous workplace incidents causing fatalities and injuries between 2015 and 2023. Accidents such as toxic gas leaks highlight systemic vulnerabilities in occupational safety practices and regulatory audits. Problematic labor arrangements, including inadequate wages, excessive hours, and arbitrary dismissals, worsen the situation. Discrimination against female employees, such as barriers to menstrual leave and workplace harassment, further undermine worker welfare, leading to ethical concerns and the withdrawal of investors from nickel projects in Indonesia.)
/Alt ()
