/P 3953 0 R
/T (Nickel Ore Export Ban: In 2014, Indonesia has imposed the first export ban on nickel ore based on Law No.4 of 2009 on Mineral and Coal. This ban was then relaxed in 2017. However, at the end of 2019, the government implemented a stronger measure by imposing Law No.3 of 2020 on Mineral and Coal. Since the second export ban, nickel-related sectors have generated significant economic value-added creation. Despite this, challenges remain in the implementation, including unfair market structure, trade retaliations and disputes, and suboptimal value-added creation. )
/E (Nickel Ore Export Ban: In 2014, Indonesia has imposed the first export ban on nickel ore based on Law No.4 of 2009 on Mineral and Coal. This ban was then relaxed in 2017. However, at the end of 2019, the government implemented a stronger measure by imposing Law No.3 of 2020 on Mineral and Coal. Since the second export ban, nickel-related sectors have generated significant economic value-added creation. Despite this, challenges remain in the implementation, including unfair market structure, trade retaliations and disputes, and suboptimal value-added creation. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
