/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 3954 0 R
/T (Resource-based Industrialization Strategies: Beyond the export ban, Indonesia has formulated local content requirements \(LCR\) to develop its domestic electric vehicle \(EV\) ecosystem. The Presidential Regulation \(PR\) No. 79/2023 \(Peraturan Presiden 79/2023\), which revises the more ambitious targets set in the PR No. 55/2019 \(Peraturan Presiden 55/2019\), mandates a 40% of LCR for EV cars in 2026, 60% in 2029, and 80% thereafter. Additionally, to provide more business certainty, Indonesia has established special economic zones \(SEZ\) and national strategic projects \(Proyek Strategis Nasional/PSN\) with special incentives and sound institutional mechanisms to attract more investors to nickel-based industries.)
/E (Resource-based Industrialization Strategies: Beyond the export ban, Indonesia has formulated local content requirements \(LCR\) to develop its domestic electric vehicle \(EV\) ecosystem. The Presidential Regulation \(PR\) No. 79/2023 \(Peraturan Presiden 79/2023\), which revises the more ambitious targets set in the PR No. 55/2019 \(Peraturan Presiden 55/2019\), mandates a 40% of LCR for EV cars in 2026, 60% in 2029, and 80% thereafter. Additionally, to provide more business certainty, Indonesia has established special economic zones \(SEZ\) and national strategic projects \(Proyek Strategis Nasional/PSN\) with special incentives and sound institutional mechanisms to attract more investors to nickel-based industries.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 19 0 R
