/S /H2
/P 3960 0 R
/T (Land Dispute: The Indonesian government listed nickel processing facilities and industrial parks such as IMIP, IWIP, and smelters as national strategic projects \(PSN\) under Presidential Decree No. 109 of 2020, providing them with state facilitation, including land acquisition dispute resolution. However, numerous land disputes suggest inconsistent implementation. Furthermore, GR No. 64 of 2021 on Land Banking is being criticized for expanding government control over land and easing foreign corporate access, risks exacerbating land conflicts, displacing local communities, and undermining equitable land governance.)
/E (Land Dispute: The Indonesian government listed nickel processing facilities and industrial parks such as IMIP, IWIP, and smelters as national strategic projects \(PSN\) under Presidential Decree No. 109 of 2020, providing them with state facilitation, including land acquisition dispute resolution. However, numerous land disputes suggest inconsistent implementation. Furthermore, GR No. 64 of 2021 on Land Banking is being criticized for expanding government control over land and easing foreign corporate access, risks exacerbating land conflicts, displacing local communities, and undermining equitable land governance.)
