/T (Improving emission and pollution control: The government should advocate for cleaner energy sources for smelters, prohibit Deep Sea Tailings Placement \(DSTP\), and enforce stricter environmental standards that align with global benchmarks. This includes bolstering the monitoring and enforcement of pollution controls, mandating PROPER participation for high-risk industries, and increasing transparency in corporate environmental practices to ensure accountability and reduce environmental harm.)
/E (Improving emission and pollution control: The government should advocate for cleaner energy sources for smelters, prohibit Deep Sea Tailings Placement \(DSTP\), and enforce stricter environmental standards that align with global benchmarks. This includes bolstering the monitoring and enforcement of pollution controls, mandating PROPER participation for high-risk industries, and increasing transparency in corporate environmental practices to ensure accountability and reduce environmental harm.)
