/T (Preventing local job displacement: To address the influx of low-skilled foreign workers, complementary provisions, such as quotas and monitoring mechanisms, should be added to the RPTKA. These measures could prevent worsening social tension between local and foreign workers and encourage firms to prioritize entry for higher skilled workers.)
/E (Preventing local job displacement: To address the influx of low-skilled foreign workers, complementary provisions, such as quotas and monitoring mechanisms, should be added to the RPTKA. These measures could prevent worsening social tension between local and foreign workers and encourage firms to prioritize entry for higher skilled workers.)
