1300 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Although nickel downstream has a relatively small impact on the national economy, it plays a significant role at the regional level. On a macro level, nickel mining and industry activities have greatly expanded the local economy. Since 2021, several nickel-producing provinces \(North Maluku and Central Sulawesi\) had performed a high economic growth relative to the previous period \(Figure 2.4\). This growth, particularly in North Maluku, is primarily driven by the metal ore mining and metal industry sectors \(Figure 2.5 and Figure 2.6\). The second export ban of nickel ore \(2019/2020\) has led to the rapid growth of nickel-based industries in North Maluku, including in Weda Bay and Obi Island. )
/E (Although nickel downstream has a relatively small impact on the national economy, it plays a significant role at the regional level. On a macro level, nickel mining and industry activities have greatly expanded the local economy. Since 2021, several nickel-producing provinces \(North Maluku and Central Sulawesi\) had performed a high economic growth relative to the previous period \(Figure 2.4\). This growth, particularly in North Maluku, is primarily driven by the metal ore mining and metal industry sectors \(Figure 2.5 and Figure 2.6\). The second export ban of nickel ore \(2019/2020\) has led to the rapid growth of nickel-based industries in North Maluku, including in Weda Bay and Obi Island. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
