1388 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Employment gains in mining and manufacturing have shown significant improvement in nickel-rich provinces. The mining and quarrying sector in Central and Southeast Sulawesi soared in 2013, just a year before the first nickel export restriction took place in 2015 \(Figure 2.14\). Subsequently, the re-implementation of the nickel export ban in 2020 sparked employment expansion across North Maluku, Central Sulawesi, and Southeast Sulawesi. Nevertheless, considering that the mining and quarrying sector historically stands as the third largest employer of informal workers in the Indonesian economy \(Asian Development Bank, 2009\), reliance on it for achieving formal employment transformation appears imprudent. )
/E (Employment gains in mining and manufacturing have shown significant improvement in nickel-rich provinces. The mining and quarrying sector in Central and Southeast Sulawesi soared in 2013, just a year before the first nickel export restriction took place in 2015 \(Figure 2.14\). Subsequently, the re-implementation of the nickel export ban in 2020 sparked employment expansion across North Maluku, Central Sulawesi, and Southeast Sulawesi. Nevertheless, considering that the mining and quarrying sector historically stands as the third largest employer of informal workers in the Indonesian economy \(Asian Development Bank, 2009\), reliance on it for achieving formal employment transformation appears imprudent. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [8 9]
>>
endobj
