/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Within five years, North Maluku's manufacturing employment surpassed that of both Southeast and Central Sulawesi, establishing it as the leading nickel-producing region in Indonesia. This increase in manufacturing employment in North Maluku indicates a positive relationship between nickel manufacturing activities, value addition policies, and regional employment growth.)
/E (Within five years, North Maluku's manufacturing employment surpassed that of both Southeast and Central Sulawesi, establishing it as the leading nickel-producing region in Indonesia. This increase in manufacturing employment in North Maluku indicates a positive relationship between nickel manufacturing activities, value addition policies, and regional employment growth.)
