/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Unlike North Maluku, Central Sulawesi experienced a decline in manufacturing employment during the 2020 ban period, although a rise was noted between 2021 and 2022. While local economic gains suggest potential improvement, it remains to be determined whether these gains will correlate with positive changes in social indicators like poverty rates. We will discuss this in the social impact section.)
/E (Unlike North Maluku, Central Sulawesi experienced a decline in manufacturing employment during the 2020 ban period, although a rise was noted between 2021 and 2022. While local economic gains suggest potential improvement, it remains to be determined whether these gains will correlate with positive changes in social indicators like poverty rates. We will discuss this in the social impact section.)
