1902 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Rivers in nickel-producing areas have also suffered severe degradation. According to a press release by the Halmahera Studies Forum \(Foshal\), Wahana Lingkungan Hidup Indonesia \(Walhi\) North Maluku, and Trend Asia, nickel downstream activities have devastated the Akejira and Ake Kobe Rivers in Central Halmahera \(Pristiandaru, 2024\). Similarly, the Sageyan River in North Weda, Central Halmahera, has shown signs of contamination, with its waters frequently turning reddish-brown even without rainfall. An investigation by Forest Watch Indonesia \(FWI\) in September 2023 attributed this discoloration to soil erosion caused by deforestation in the upstream watershed area, which falls within mining concessions \(FWI, 2023\).)
/E (Rivers in nickel-producing areas have also suffered severe degradation. According to a press release by the Halmahera Studies Forum \(Foshal\), Wahana Lingkungan Hidup Indonesia \(Walhi\) North Maluku, and Trend Asia, nickel downstream activities have devastated the Akejira and Ake Kobe Rivers in Central Halmahera \(Pristiandaru, 2024\). Similarly, the Sageyan River in North Weda, Central Halmahera, has shown signs of contamination, with its waters frequently turning reddish-brown even without rainfall. An investigation by Forest Watch Indonesia \(FWI\) in September 2023 attributed this discoloration to soil erosion caused by deforestation in the upstream watershed area, which falls within mining concessions \(FWI, 2023\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
