1983 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The report attributes these conflicts to regulatory modifications that have streamlined the process for mining companies and nickel processing industries to clear land. The classification of nickel mining companies under National Strategic Projects \(Proyek Strategis Nasional/PSN\) status further facilitates expedited land clearance. In combination with inadequate enforcement of responsible land acquisition practices, these factors have fostered contentious land procurement processes that subsequently trigger conflicts between local communities and nickel companies.)
/E (The report attributes these conflicts to regulatory modifications that have streamlined the process for mining companies and nickel processing industries to clear land. The classification of nickel mining companies under National Strategic Projects \(Proyek Strategis Nasional/PSN\) status further facilitates expedited land clearance. In combination with inadequate enforcement of responsible land acquisition practices, these factors have fostered contentious land procurement processes that subsequently trigger conflicts between local communities and nickel companies.)
