/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (These issues collectively undermine worker welfare and pose a significant deterrent to prospective investors concerned about reputational damage, as evidenced by the reported withdrawal of two multinational corporations from a multi-billion-dollar nickel-cobalt refinery project, driven by ethical and sustainability apprehensions linked to nickel sourcing in Indonesia \(Shennum, 2024\). Consequently, these dynamics underscore an urgent need for comprehensive reforms to mitigate the profound social and human costs associated with the nickel mining and downstream industries in Indonesia.)
/E (These issues collectively undermine worker welfare and pose a significant deterrent to prospective investors concerned about reputational damage, as evidenced by the reported withdrawal of two multinational corporations from a multi-billion-dollar nickel-cobalt refinery project, driven by ethical and sustainability apprehensions linked to nickel sourcing in Indonesia \(Shennum, 2024\). Consequently, these dynamics underscore an urgent need for comprehensive reforms to mitigate the profound social and human costs associated with the nickel mining and downstream industries in Indonesia.)
