/E (While we acknowledge that our policy mapping might not capture every single policy that has influenced the observed outcomes, our analysis focuses on the policies that are both relevant and exert the most substantial potential impact on the findings presented in Chapter 2. The policy mapping results presented in this chapter will serve as the groundwork for formulating policy recommendations in a subsequent chapter, enabling us to propose informed and targeted adjustments to mitigate negative impacts and promote sustainable practices.)
