/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In addition to its other provisions, this law also aims to restructure land regulations through the establishment of Indonesia Land Bank Authority. This authority is responsible for the land acquisition, land management, and land distribution for public interest, including the industrial and technological development zones \(Tempo, 2021\). This initiative, along with the strengthening of land management rights, may help reduce institutional uncertainties and transaction costs in  land provision, thereby improving the investment climate and ease of doing business. )
