2033 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Resource revenue distribution is crucial  to ensure that regional governments benefit from mining and industries activities. Indonesia has established a mechanism to share the resource revenue to regional governments through the Law No. 1/2022 \(Undang-Undang 1/2022\). This law specifically regulates the revenue sharing fund for resource-rich provincial governments and resource-rich cities/regencies-level governments, and their neighboring regions. Currently, the revenue sharing fund for mineral resources consists of land-rent \(iuran tetap\) and royalty \(iuran produksi\). Given the high revenue sharing mechanism to provincial and cities/regencies-level government currently \(80%\), this privilege should be utilized productively and efficiently. There should be a nickel revenue management in the regional government, considering the dynamic price of commodities and the fact that nickel is a nonrenewable resource. )
/E (Resource revenue distribution is crucial  to ensure that regional governments benefit from mining and industries activities. Indonesia has established a mechanism to share the resource revenue to regional governments through the Law No. 1/2022 \(Undang-Undang 1/2022\). This law specifically regulates the revenue sharing fund for resource-rich provincial governments and resource-rich cities/regencies-level governments, and their neighboring regions. Currently, the revenue sharing fund for mineral resources consists of land-rent \(iuran tetap\) and royalty \(iuran produksi\). Given the high revenue sharing mechanism to provincial and cities/regencies-level government currently \(80%\), this privilege should be utilized productively and efficiently. There should be a nickel revenue management in the regional government, considering the dynamic price of commodities and the fact that nickel is a nonrenewable resource. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [8 9]
>>
endobj
2034 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The role of regional government is crucial in enhancing local welfare, and the utilization of resource revenue is vital to fund development initiatives. The allocation of revenue should be regulated for several purposes. First, it can be used to expand productive sectors, thereby diversifying the nickel-rich regions. This is important to secure high and sustainable growth for the region. Second, resource revenue can be allocated to compensate affected sectors and individuals, as nickel mining and industrial activities may negatively impact certain groups. Third, the use of resource revenue is also important to prepare for future transitions, considering the possibility of resource depletion or substitution by the technological advancements.)
/E (The role of regional government is crucial in enhancing local welfare, and the utilization of resource revenue is vital to fund development initiatives. The allocation of revenue should be regulated for several purposes. First, it can be used to expand productive sectors, thereby diversifying the nickel-rich regions. This is important to secure high and sustainable growth for the region. Second, resource revenue can be allocated to compensate affected sectors and individuals, as nickel mining and industrial activities may negatively impact certain groups. Third, the use of resource revenue is also important to prepare for future transitions, considering the possibility of resource depletion or substitution by the technological advancements.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [10]
>>
