2038 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The concept of National Strategic Projects \(PSN\) in Indonesia has become increasingly controversial due to its vague criteria. Law No. 6/2023 on Job Creation fails to clearly define what constitutes "strategic" and "national" in the context of PSN. This unclear definition leading to arbitrary classifications where numerous projects are labeled as PSN without delivering significant public benefits, especially for the people around the project. Currently, 280 projects are designated as PSN, including nine industrial zones related to nickel, with nickel smelter development positioned as a key program.  This raises critical concerns, as many PSN initiatives, particularly those driven by the private sector, prioritize economic growth and investment over equitable development and environmental sustainability.)
/E (The concept of National Strategic Projects \(PSN\) in Indonesia has become increasingly controversial due to its vague criteria. Law No. 6/2023 on Job Creation fails to clearly define what constitutes "strategic" and "national" in the context of PSN. This unclear definition leading to arbitrary classifications where numerous projects are labeled as PSN without delivering significant public benefits, especially for the people around the project. Currently, 280 projects are designated as PSN, including nine industrial zones related to nickel, with nickel smelter development positioned as a key program.  This raises critical concerns, as many PSN initiatives, particularly those driven by the private sector, prioritize economic growth and investment over equitable development and environmental sustainability.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [13 14]
>>
