/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The legal framework governing the acceleration of PSN, particularly as outlined in Government Regulation No. 42/2021 and Presidential Regulation No. 109/2020, provides an array of privileges to PSN projects. These include government guarantees for technically and financially feasible initiatives, streamlined access to financing through Public-Private Partnerships \(PPP\), and extensive political risk mitigation. While these measures are designed to attract investors, they also create an environment where projects, such as nickel downstream operations, can proceed with minimal scrutiny.)
/E (The legal framework governing the acceleration of PSN, particularly as outlined in Government Regulation No. 42/2021 and Presidential Regulation No. 109/2020, provides an array of privileges to PSN projects. These include government guarantees for technically and financially feasible initiatives, streamlined access to financing through Public-Private Partnerships \(PPP\), and extensive political risk mitigation. While these measures are designed to attract investors, they also create an environment where projects, such as nickel downstream operations, can proceed with minimal scrutiny.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [2]
>>
