/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Article 84 of GR No. 23/2021 further undermines forest protection by allowing the conversion of protected and conservation forests, particularly for National Strategic Projects \(PSN\). These projects only requires proposals from the Minister or the head of the relevant institution, bypassing the involvement of local governments or forest area managers. This regulation permits projects to proceed even in provinces already experiencing forest deficits, where existing forest cover is insufficient to support ecological balance, watershed functions, and biodiversity conservation \(Maqoma, 2021\). )
/E (Article 84 of GR No. 23/2021 further undermines forest protection by allowing the conversion of protected and conservation forests, particularly for National Strategic Projects \(PSN\). These projects only requires proposals from the Minister or the head of the relevant institution, bypassing the involvement of local governments or forest area managers. This regulation permits projects to proceed even in provinces already experiencing forest deficits, where existing forest cover is insufficient to support ecological balance, watershed functions, and biodiversity conservation \(Maqoma, 2021\). )
/Alt ()
/Pg 66 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
2093 0 obj
