/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The permitting process has also been drastically accelerated, reducing approval times from 104 to just 34 days, enabling project activities to begin almost immediately after permit issuance. This rushed approval system severely limits environmental assessments, increasing the risks of deforestation and biodiversity loss while prioritizing economic expansion over sustainability. Under Article 94 of GR No. 23/2021, project developers are even exempt from paying non-tax state revenues \(PNBP\) for forest area usage and compensation fees, reducing the financial obligations typically associated with exploiting forest resources.)
/E (The permitting process has also been drastically accelerated, reducing approval times from 104 to just 34 days, enabling project activities to begin almost immediately after permit issuance. This rushed approval system severely limits environmental assessments, increasing the risks of deforestation and biodiversity loss while prioritizing economic expansion over sustainability. Under Article 94 of GR No. 23/2021, project developers are even exempt from paying non-tax state revenues \(PNBP\) for forest area usage and compensation fees, reducing the financial obligations typically associated with exploiting forest resources.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 66 0 R
