/T (Despite the regulatory measures, the precautionary principle, which emphasizes prevention over remediation, suggests that such waste disposal practices should not be permitted at all \(AEER, 2023\). Research by WALHI North Maluku indicates that seawater quality around Obi Island exceeds government-set thresholds, with murky waters and fish contaminated with heavy metals. Similarly, DSTP activities at PT Indonesia Morowali Industrial Park \(IMIP\) have caused severe environmental degradation, including reduced fish catches and damage to coral reefs, seagrass beds, and mangrove forests \(Rachmawati, 2024\).)
/E (Despite the regulatory measures, the precautionary principle, which emphasizes prevention over remediation, suggests that such waste disposal practices should not be permitted at all \(AEER, 2023\). Research by WALHI North Maluku indicates that seawater quality around Obi Island exceeds government-set thresholds, with murky waters and fish contaminated with heavy metals. Similarly, DSTP activities at PT Indonesia Morowali Industrial Park \(IMIP\) have caused severe environmental degradation, including reduced fish catches and damage to coral reefs, seagrass beds, and mangrove forests \(Rachmawati, 2024\).)
