/T (Our desk research reveals that the environmental impact has emerged as the most notable concern compared to other aspects. Consequently, environmental safeguards occupy a substantial portion of our policy mapping. This highlights a crucial issue with the implementation of these environmental safeguards and raises an important question: Does improving the investment climate necessarily require weakening environmental protections? Are there alternative strategies that can enhance the investment climate without compromising these essential safeguards?)
/E (Our desk research reveals that the environmental impact has emerged as the most notable concern compared to other aspects. Consequently, environmental safeguards occupy a substantial portion of our policy mapping. This highlights a crucial issue with the implementation of these environmental safeguards and raises an important question: Does improving the investment climate necessarily require weakening environmental protections? Are there alternative strategies that can enhance the investment climate without compromising these essential safeguards?)
/Alt ()
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [5]
