/S /H2
/T (As the demand for sustainable commodities continues to grow, the importance of strong safeguards becomes even more crucial. The global shift towards energy transition highlights the need for robust protections to ensure long-term sustainable growth in Indonesia's mining and industrial sectors. The challenge lies in finding a balanced approach that fosters investment while safeguarding both the environment and society.)
/E (As the demand for sustainable commodities continues to grow, the importance of strong safeguards becomes even more crucial. The global shift towards energy transition highlights the need for robust protections to ensure long-term sustainable growth in Indonesia's mining and industrial sectors. The challenge lies in finding a balanced approach that fosters investment while safeguarding both the environment and society.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [6]
