/T (To develop effective policies that  address the triple bottom line challenges of the nickel industry and ensure a more sustainable downstream process, Indonesia must learn from the experiences of other countries. These case studies serve as benchmarks, enabling Indonesia to adopt best practices tailored to the specific challenges and bottlenecks within its current regulatory framework. The following examples  highlight good policy practices from various countries concerning the economic, social, and environmental aspects of the nickel industry.)
