/P 3998 0 R
/E (South Korea: The Waste Control Act regulates hazardous waste management, disposal, and recycling to protect health and the environment. Proposed amendments promote battery recycling by recognizing black mass as a recyclable resource, reducing regulatory burdens and aligning with EU and US practices.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [8]
>>
