/P 4006 0 R
/T (Conducting a Strategic Coordination: Considering its encompassing sectors and stakeholders, downstream strategies should be well managed and coordinated. A strong coordination between national and local government is required in managing the downstream activities. Additionally, coherence in the policy-making process is essential, such as aligning local content requirement \(LCR\) requirements, infrastructure readiness and domestic production capacity\).)
/E (Conducting a Strategic Coordination: Considering its encompassing sectors and stakeholders, downstream strategies should be well managed and coordinated. A strong coordination between national and local government is required in managing the downstream activities. Additionally, coherence in the policy-making process is essential, such as aligning local content requirement \(LCR\) requirements, infrastructure readiness and domestic production capacity\).)
/Alt ()
