/T (The government must also prevent corruption and bribery to ensure that permits are granted to those who adhere to best practices. Additionally, stricter regulations should be enforced to prevent IUP grantees from subcontracting mining activities to third parties that undermine ESG compliance through cost-cutting and poor oversight.)
/E (The government must also prevent corruption and bribery to ensure that permits are granted to those who adhere to best practices. Additionally, stricter regulations should be enforced to prevent IUP grantees from subcontracting mining activities to third parties that undermine ESG compliance through cost-cutting and poor oversight.)
