2200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 4008 0 R
/T (Strengthening Environmental Impact Assessment \(AMDAL\) Procedures: AMDAL assessments must be conducted before project approvals to prevent environmental damage. A more rigorous screening process should ensure that only companies with sustainable practices receive permits. Public participation should be reinstated, allowing communities and civil society organizations to challenge AMDAL approvals and increase transparency. Besides, penalties for individuals or communities opposing environmentally harmful mining activities should be removed, ensuring legal protection for environmental defenders. Empowering local governments, as the authorities closest to mineral operations, is essential for strengthening oversight and ensuring compliance with environmental regulations. Enhancing the capacity and quality of supervisory bodies is also critical, given the increasing number of permits issued that require effective monitoring.)
/E (Strengthening Environmental Impact Assessment \(AMDAL\) Procedures: AMDAL assessments must be conducted before project approvals to prevent environmental damage. A more rigorous screening process should ensure that only companies with sustainable practices receive permits. Public participation should be reinstated, allowing communities and civil society organizations to challenge AMDAL approvals and increase transparency. Besides, penalties for individuals or communities opposing environmentally harmful mining activities should be removed, ensuring legal protection for environmental defenders. Empowering local governments, as the authorities closest to mineral operations, is essential for strengthening oversight and ensuring compliance with environmental regulations. Enhancing the capacity and quality of supervisory bodies is also critical, given the increasing number of permits issued that require effective monitoring.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 75 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
