2215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 4016 0 R
/T (Promoting the Use of Cleaner Energy for Smelters: The Indonesian government should mandate and incentivize the transition to cleaner energy sources for nickel smelting operations to reduce reliance on coal-fired captive power plants \(PLTU Captive\) and minimize carbon emissions from the nickel industry. Shifting energy sources, though not fully renewable, is a practical and achievable solution. For example, the use of gas and LNG can serve as a cleaner alternative to coal, significantly reducing carbon emissions. Besides, implementing Carbon Capture, Utilization, and Storage \(CCUS\) technologies can help mitigate emissions from existing fossil fuel-based operations. In the long term, hydrogen energy offers a promising zero-emission solution. While these alternatives may not be fully renewable, they represent a critical step toward reducing the environmental impact of smelting operations while ensuring energy reliability.)
/E (Promoting the Use of Cleaner Energy for Smelters: The Indonesian government should mandate and incentivize the transition to cleaner energy sources for nickel smelting operations to reduce reliance on coal-fired captive power plants \(PLTU Captive\) and minimize carbon emissions from the nickel industry. Shifting energy sources, though not fully renewable, is a practical and achievable solution. For example, the use of gas and LNG can serve as a cleaner alternative to coal, significantly reducing carbon emissions. Besides, implementing Carbon Capture, Utilization, and Storage \(CCUS\) technologies can help mitigate emissions from existing fossil fuel-based operations. In the long term, hydrogen energy offers a promising zero-emission solution. While these alternatives may not be fully renewable, they represent a critical step toward reducing the environmental impact of smelting operations while ensuring energy reliability.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [11]
>>
