/P 4019 0 R
/T (Enhancing Enforcement and Transparency in PROPER: The voluntary nature of PROPER allows non-participating companies to avoid oversight and sanctions, diminishing weakening its effectiveness as an environmental compliance tool. Moreover, the lack of enforcement means that companies found in violation often face no consequences, while limited transparency prevents public access to information on black-rated companies. To improve PROPER participation should be mandatory for high-risk industries, ensuring consistent monitoring and accountability. KLHK must also enhance transparency by publicly disclosing company ratings and violations, enabling greater corporate responsibility and public oversight.)
/E (Enhancing Enforcement and Transparency in PROPER: The voluntary nature of PROPER allows non-participating companies to avoid oversight and sanctions, diminishing weakening its effectiveness as an environmental compliance tool. Moreover, the lack of enforcement means that companies found in violation often face no consequences, while limited transparency prevents public access to information on black-rated companies. To improve PROPER participation should be mandatory for high-risk industries, ensuring consistent monitoring and accountability. KLHK must also enhance transparency by publicly disclosing company ratings and violations, enabling greater corporate responsibility and public oversight.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 77 0 R
/K [8]
