/T (Enforcing Occupational Safety and Health \(OSH\) Standards: To incentivize compliance with proper OSH standards in nickel mining and manufacturing companies, clear enforcement mechanisms should be enacted. These mechanisms can include impartial investigations of potential violations and the imposition of escalating penalties in cases of suspected non-compliance. Besides, the government should consider limiting companies' image-improvement activities, particularly when there is evidence of OSH violations or attempts to cover workplace accidents.)
/E (Enforcing Occupational Safety and Health \(OSH\) Standards: To incentivize compliance with proper OSH standards in nickel mining and manufacturing companies, clear enforcement mechanisms should be enacted. These mechanisms can include impartial investigations of potential violations and the imposition of escalating penalties in cases of suspected non-compliance. Besides, the government should consider limiting companies' image-improvement activities, particularly when there is evidence of OSH violations or attempts to cover workplace accidents.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 78 0 R
/K [6]
