/S /H2
/T (Based on the impact and policy mapping gap analysis on the nickel downstream, this policy paper formulates a set of recommendations from the economic, social, and environmental perspectives. These recommendations are not exhaustive, as this paper focuses only on the most pressing and relevant issues. The policy recommendations are presented in three aspects separately, yet cross-cutting issues among all of three sectors were identified in the impact analysis and policy mapping, necessitating the formation of a comprehensive set of policy reform.)
/E (Based on the impact and policy mapping gap analysis on the nickel downstream, this policy paper formulates a set of recommendations from the economic, social, and environmental perspectives. These recommendations are not exhaustive, as this paper focuses only on the most pressing and relevant issues. The policy recommendations are presented in three aspects separately, yet cross-cutting issues among all of three sectors were identified in the impact analysis and policy mapping, necessitating the formation of a comprehensive set of policy reform.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 78 0 R
