2234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Considering the intersection of economic, social, and environmental aspects, the comprehensive set of policy reforms must address each objective without creating trade-offs with other aspects. Long-term reforms should be institutionalized to ensure sustainable growth in the nickel-rich regions. Given the existing harm to environmental and social aspects, coupled with the current suboptimal economic value-added creation from nickel downstream, it is necessary to initiate policy reforms immediately before Indonesia enters its nickel depletion phase. Further research avenues can involve efforts to enhance transparency and accountability in nickel-related mining and manufacturing industries, supported by more robust data. In addition, current studies on nickel downstream are  still incomplete; therefore, further studies can be extended to encompass many other aspects.)
/E (Considering the intersection of economic, social, and environmental aspects, the comprehensive set of policy reforms must address each objective without creating trade-offs with other aspects. Long-term reforms should be institutionalized to ensure sustainable growth in the nickel-rich regions. Given the existing harm to environmental and social aspects, coupled with the current suboptimal economic value-added creation from nickel downstream, it is necessary to initiate policy reforms immediately before Indonesia enters its nickel depletion phase. Further research avenues can involve efforts to enhance transparency and accountability in nickel-related mining and manufacturing industries, supported by more robust data. In addition, current studies on nickel downstream are  still incomplete; therefore, further studies can be extended to encompass many other aspects.)
/Alt ()
